00:00:56,221 --> 00:01:06,500
However, the technology employed to bring the enemy to its knees in only a matter of

11
00:01:06,501 --> 00:01:15,460
weeks is directly descended from another conflict fought more than 140 years ago, the American

12
00:01:15,461 --> 00:01:17,460
Civil War.

13
00:01:17,461 --> 00:01:24,460
The Civil War was the first of the great modern wars.

14
00:01:24,461 --> 00:01:30,460
In its four short years, warfare evolved some 500 years to what it had been.

15
00:01:30,461 --> 00:01:35,460
Beyond any shadow of a doubt, there's a very direct correlation

16
00:01:35,461 --> 00:01:38,460
between the technology used in the American Civil War

17
00:01:38,461 --> 00:01:41,460
and the technology being used in today's military.

18
00:01:47,460 --> 00:01:53,980
In fact, newfound discoveries, such as the first Union ironclad warship, the USS Monitor,

19
